        "raw": "<p>Some great news, and some not so great news. First off the first three days have been phenominal! Teaching has been great fun with Baron Blade and Spite as well as Aberscade taking some pretty stiff defeats. This morning the Villian almost stole my voice, but I rallied! Everyone has been so positive and excited about the game, many wanted to buy it on the spot!</p><p>And the not so great news, my car has been hit by some of Tempests rogue lighting bolts, or perhaps it was Haka being a bit too enthusiastic when Dino wranging... either way my car has surrendered and I will have to get it 2 hours north of Columbus tomorrow so it can get healed up, hopefully Monday. All this to say I will be unable to Demo tomorrow.</p><p>The CABS library does has the first edition as well as Rook City so have no fear if you still attend there will be some Senitnels to be played! When I return to my home town I plan on writing up a more thorough recap (I even took notes!) So look forward to more details in the next couple days! Many thanks again to Christopher and the rest of the Sentinels crew for making this awesome game we all get to enjoy and share!</p>",
